# LOOM-8 demo: hip hop, boom bap, 90 BPM swung, C minor (Cm9 Fm9 Bb9 Ebmaj9). (tools/demos/render.sh renders it; its
# bank is build/demos/hiphop.bin: a bar of the funky drummer and a horn stab made by tools/demos/make_banks.py,
# private.)
#   T1 slice: the funky drummer in 16, mono, re-chopped and swung, its pitch two semitones down (heavier), through
#      twelve bits at a lower rate (the SP-1200's grit)
#   T2 kit: a hard kick and a long snare under the break (the boom and the bap)
#   T3 tines "felt bass": the bass       T4 tines "soft felt": the Rhodes, its tremolo on, chords held
#   T5 sample: the horn stab (user 2, a Bb7, its root Bb3), moved to each chord's root on the hook
#   T6 sample: the factory "ah" scratched: short notes with the bend trick, the portamento trick
#   T7 cane "bamboo": the hook's flute (Braids' flute model, its vibrato)
# The dust is the break's: twelve bits at a lower rate. Song: intro 2, verse 8, hook 4, verse 2 4, hook 4, outro 2 (the
# break filtered out).
master 4096
samples build/demos/hiphop.bin
bpm 90
groove swing

# ---- the sounds (boom bap: dusty and dark, narrow. The break through a sampler's twelve bits, low-passed; a boom of
# a kick and a cracking snare under it; the bass and the Rhodes filtered; the horn and the scratch dry; a short
# room; the master warm and narrow, the low end up)
# T1 the funky drummer in 16, mono, two semitones down (heavier): twelve bits at a lower rate (the SP-1200's
# grit), low-passed
knob 1 engine slice
preset 1 chop slice
knob 1 e1 u1
knob 1 e3 62
knob 1 e4 127
knob 1 cut 104
knob 1 ctype crush
knob 1 camt 30
knob 1 ctone 64
knob 1 cmix 127
knob 1 brain no
knob 1 level 104
knob 1 send2 8
# T2 the kit: the boom (a deep, long kick, its punch up) and the bap (a snare with its crack up, the wires long)
knob 2 engine kit
knob 2 d1.k1 74
knob 2 d1.k2 76
knob 2 d1.k3 96
knob 2 d1.k4 46
knob 2 d2.k1 72
knob 2 d2.k2 66
knob 2 d2.k3 104
knob 2 d2.k4 96
knob 2 d2.volume 80
knob 2 d3.k4 70
knob 2 d3.volume 46
knob 2 res 60
knob 2 fenv 50
knob 2 level 82
knob 2 send2 10
# T3 tines "felt bass": the bass, round and low-passed
preset 3 felt_bass tines
# (the song was written before a bass preset sat an octave down)
param 3 oct 2
knob 3 brain no
knob 3 cut 64
knob 3 level 103
# T4 tines "soft felt": the dusty Rhodes, its tremolo on, chords held, darker
preset 4 soft_felt tines
knob 4 brain no
knob 4 ltype wobble
knob 4 lspeed 76
knob 4 lamt 64
knob 4 ldest 100
knob 4 cut 84
knob 4 level 87
knob 4 send2 24
# T5 the horn stab (user 2, a Bb7, its root Bb3), driven, dry
knob 5 engine sample
knob 5 e1 u2
knob 5 e4 one-shot
knob 5 vmode poly
knob 5 a 0
knob 5 s 127
knob 5 r 50
knob 5 cut 96
knob 5 ctype drive
knob 5 camt 50
knob 5 brain no
knob 5 level 91
knob 5 send2 20
# T6 the factory "ah" scratched: short notes with the bend trick, crushed
knob 6 engine sample
knob 6 e1 ah
knob 6 e2 20
knob 6 e3 50
knob 6 e4 one-shot
knob 6 vmode mono
knob 6 porta 20
knob 6 bend octave
knob 6 a 0
knob 6 s 127
knob 6 r 20
knob 6 cut 105
knob 6 res 30
knob 6 ctype crush
knob 6 camt 40
knob 6 brain no
knob 6 level 83
# T7 cane "bamboo": the hook's flute
preset 7 bamboo cane
knob 7 brain no
knob 7 level 82
knob 7 send2 30
# FX II a short room
knob 12 engine room
# the master: the low end up, narrow
mst lo 74
mst hi 64
mst comp 40
mst level 90

# ---- T1 the break (slice k = note 52 + k): P1 straight, P2 re-chopped (kick doubled, ghost snares moved), P3 the
# hook's (a stutter on the last beat)
