notes 1 1 1 0 120 53
notes 1 1 2 0 105 54
notes 1 1 3 0 110 55
notes 1 1 4 0 105 56
notes 1 1 5 0 120 57
notes 1 1 6 0 105 58
notes 1 1 7 0 110 59
notes 1 1 8 0 105 60
notes 1 1 9 0 115 61
notes 1 1 10 0 105 62
notes 1 1 11 0 110 63
notes 1 1 12 0 105 64
notes 1 1 13 0 120 65
notes 1 1 14 0 105 66
notes 1 1 15 0 110 67
notes 1 1 16 0 105 68
pat 1 2 16 1 100 35
notes 1 2 1 0 120 53
notes 1 2 2 0 105 54
notes 1 2 3 0 110 55
notes 1 2 4 0 110 53
notes 1 2 5 0 120 57
notes 1 2 6 0 105 58
notes 1 2 7 0 110 56
notes 1 2 8 0 105 60
notes 1 2 9 0 115 61
notes 1 2 10 0 110 53
notes 1 2 11 0 110 63
notes 1 2 12 0 105 58
notes 1 2 13 0 120 65
notes 1 2 14 0 105 66
notes 1 2 15 0 110 64
notes 1 2 16 0 105 60
chance 1 2 10 1:2
pat 1 3 16 1 100 35
notes 1 3 1 0 120 53
notes 1 3 2 0 105 54
notes 1 3 3 0 110 55
notes 1 3 4 0 110 53
notes 1 3 5 0 120 57
notes 1 3 6 0 105 58
notes 1 3 7 0 110 59
notes 1 3 8 0 105 60
notes 1 3 9 0 115 61
notes 1 3 10 0 110 53
notes 1 3 11 0 110 63
notes 1 3 12 0 105 64
notes 1 3 13 0 120 65
notes 1 3 14 0 105 57
notes 1 3 15 0 110 57
notes 1 3 16 0 105 57
trick 1 3 15 multiply 2
trick 1 3 16 multiply 3

# ---- T2 the boom and the bap: kick 1, snare 2, hat 3
pat 2 1 16 1 50 35
hits 2 1 1 x.........x.....
hits 2 1 2 ....x.......x...
pat 2 2 16 1 50 35
hits 2 2 1 x......x..x..o..
hits 2 2 2 ....x.......x...
hits 2 2 3 ..g...g...g...g.

# ---- T3 the bass: Cm | Fm | Bb | Eb
pat 3 1 64 1 70 35
notes 3 1 1 3 110 C2
notes 3 1 7 1 90 C2
notes 3 1 11 2 100 G1
notes 3 1 14 1 90 Bb1
notes 3 1 17 3 110 F1
notes 3 1 23 1 90 F1
notes 3 1 27 2 100 C2
notes 3 1 30 1 90 Ab1
notes 3 1 33 3 110 Bb1
notes 3 1 39 1 90 Bb1
notes 3 1 43 2 100 F1
notes 3 1 46 1 90 Ab1
notes 3 1 49 3 110 Eb2
notes 3 1 55 1 90 Eb2
notes 3 1 59 2 100 Bb1
notes 3 1 62 1 90 B1
trick 3 1 62 porta 4

# ---- T4 the Rhodes: Cm9 | Fm9 | Bb9 | Ebmaj9, pushed an eighth early into bars 2 and 4
pat 4 1 64 1 100 35
notes 4 1 1 14 90 Eb3 G3 D4
notes 4 1 15 16 85 Ab3 C4 G4
notes 4 1 33 14 90 Ab3 C4 G4
notes 4 1 47 18 85 G3 Bb3 F4

# ---- T5 the horn (a Bb7 at Bb3): on the hook, hit on each chord's root, the last one doubled
pat 5 1 64 1 100 35
notes 5 1 1 2 110 C4
notes 5 1 8 1 90 C4
notes 5 1 17 2 110 F3
notes 5 1 24 1 90 F3
notes 5 1 33 2 115 Bb3
notes 5 1 36 1 100 Bb3
notes 5 1 49 2 110 Eb4
notes 5 1 56 1 95 Eb4
notes 5 1 58 1 105 Eb4
# P2 the second verse: only the Bb bar
pat 5 2 64 1 100 35
notes 5 2 33 2 110 Bb3
notes 5 2 40 1 90 Bb3

# ---- T6 the scratch: "ah" (its root A3) pushed and pulled: bends and glides on short notes
pat 6 1 32 1 100 35
notes 6 1 3 1 110 A3
trick 6 1 3 bend 5
notes 6 1 5 0.5 100 E4
trick 6 1 5 porta 2
notes 6 1 6 0.5 100 A3
trick 6 1 6 porta 2
notes 6 1 11 1 110 A3
trick 6 1 11 bend 6
notes 6 1 13 0.5 100 D4
notes 6 1 14 0.5 90 A3
trick 6 1 14 bend 1
notes 6 1 19 1 110 A3
trick 6 1 19 bend 9
notes 6 1 21 0.5 100 E4
trick 6 1 21 multiply 3
notes 6 1 27 1 110 A3
trick 6 1 27 bend 5
notes 6 1 29 0.5 100 G4
trick 6 1 29 porta 3
notes 6 1 30 0.5 100 A3
trick 6 1 30 porta 3
notes 6 1 31 1 110 E4
trick 6 1 31 bend 2

# ---- T7 cane's "bamboo": the hook's flute, lazy, on the swing
pat 7 1 64 1 100 35
notes 7 1 1 6 100 G5
notes 7 1 7 2 85 F5
notes 7 1 9 4 95 Eb5
notes 7 1 13 4 90 D5
notes 7 1 17 6 100 C5
notes 7 1 23 2 85 Eb5
notes 7 1 25 4 95 F5
notes 7 1 29 4 95 Ab5
notes 7 1 33 6 100 G5
notes 7 1 39 2 85 F5
notes 7 1 41 4 95 D5
notes 7 1 45 4 90 Bb4
notes 7 1 49 8 100 D5
notes 7 1 57 2 85 Eb5
notes 7 1 59 2 90 F5
notes 7 1 61 4 100 G5

# ---- scenes: T1 T2 T3 T4 T5 T6 T7
scenedef 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 1 .xx.xxxx
scenedef 2 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 2 ....xxxx
scenedef 3 3 2 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 3 .......x
scenedef 4 2 2 1 1 2 1 1 1
scenemute 4 .....xxx
scenedef 5 3 2 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 5 .......x
scenedef 6 1 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
scenemute 6 .xx.xxxx
song 1:2 2:8 3:4 4:4 5:4 6:2
songloop 0

# ---- play the song (HOME, SELECT to the Song page, PLAY), and perform
knob 1 cut 64
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
stats reset
wav loom_demo_hiphop.wav
tap PLAY
# intro 2: the break opening up
bars 1
knob 1 cut 84
bars 0.75
knob 1 cut 118
bars 0.25
# verse 8: a mute throw on the drums for the last beat (the classic drop-out)
bars 7.75
throw mute on perc
throw mute on mel 1
bars 0.25
throw mute off perc
throw mute off mel 1
# hook 4
bars 4
# verse 2, 4: the keys' tremolo faster
knob 4 lspeed 84
bars 4
knob 4 lspeed 76
# hook 4
bars 3.5
throw echo on mel 5
bars 0.5
throw echo off mel 5
# outro 2: the break into the filter
knob 1 cut 90
bars 1
knob 1 cut 70
bars 1
wait 3000
wavstop
stats
